  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation for Support to the Competitiveness of the Agriculture and Fisheries Sectors under COVID-19 Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ministry of Economic Development, Trade and Agriculture (MEDTA) and to the Ministry of Energy and Environmental Protection through the State Forestry Resource Agency (SFRAU), by conducting all preparatory work to facilitate the formulation and implementation of the upcoming EU Project (GCP/UKR/681882/EU)?s third component, ?Creating investment opportunities for smallholder farmers, increase their access to finance and integrate them and other rural entrepreneurs in selected and strengthened agriculture value chains,? so that it can immediately start the implementation when it materializes.</narrative>
  </description>
